  ('exam_ukpsc', 'ukpsc', 'UKPSC Upper PCS (Combined State Civil / Upper Subordinate Services)', 'UKPSC PCS', 'Uttarakhand Public Service Commission (UKPSC)', 'State PSC', 'The state''s premier civil services examination for Deputy Collector, DSP, and allied Group A/B posts.', 'The Uttarakhand Public Service Commission, headquartered at Gurukul Kangri, Haridwar, conducts the Combined State Civil / Upper Subordinate Services Examination (popularly called the UKPSC Upper PCS) to fill Group A and Group B posts such as Deputy Collector, Deputy Superintendent of Police, Assistant Commissioner (State Tax), Block Development Officer and District Panchayat Raj Officer.
